3. Quote Date

The quote/policy date is handled through Guidewire.

Important Point

The date is automatically locked from Guidewire.

Therefore:

- The date cannot be freely changed from the Digital UI.
- The date needs to be configured/set at the Guidewire level.
- If a different date is required for testing, the appropriate Guidewire configuration/test-data setup needs to be considered.

Testing Consideration

When validating date-related scenarios:

Digital Application
       ↓
Guidewire
       ↓
Date Configuration
       ↓
Digital Quote

