9. CloudWatch Log Investigation

AWS CloudWatch is used for log investigation.

Searching Logs

To search CloudWatch logs:

1. Identify the required query/search criteria.
2. Enter the query in CloudWatch.
3. Retrieve the relevant message/log entries.
4. Use the results to investigate the issue.

High-Level Flow

Issue Observed
      ↓
Identify Relevant Time/Transaction
      ↓
Prepare CloudWatch Query
      ↓
Search Message Logs
      ↓
Review Logs
      ↓
Identify Error / Exception
      ↓
Continue Investigation

Important Point

The search query needs to be appropriately constructed based on what needs to be investigated.

